  "description": "RUHNOB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C124 H106 Eu4 N6 O24,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.833-3.866 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.70-114.75°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Eu4(dbm)6(L)2(μ2-OCH3)2(CH3OH)2]·3CH3OH (C127H118Eu4N6O27).",
